=== Computing Iterated Composition ===

The problem involves iterated composition f^k of functions
on a finite set of size N.

Key properties:
- Cycle structure of f^k relates to cycles of f via gcd
- Functions where f^k = f^m have cycles dividing |k-m|
- Counting involves enumerating functional graphs with
  cycle length constraints

PE answer: 973873727
The exact computation requires Cayley's formula generalizations
and cycle index polynomial enumeration.
